diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 61a6c11..7dd65a3 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -9,8 +9,16 @@ Applies a hardened sshd configuration.
 | `sshd_port` | `22` | Port sshd listens on. |
 | `sshd_permit_root_login` | `"no"` | Value for `PermitRootLogin`. |
 | `sshd_password_authentication` | `"no"` | Value for `PasswordAuthentication`. |
+| `sshd_max_auth_tries` | `4` | Value for `MaxAuthTries`. |
+| `sshd_login_grace_time` | `30` | Value for `LoginGraceTime`, in seconds. |
 | `sshd_config_path` | `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` | Path to the sshd configuration file. |
 
 ## Supported platforms
 
-Debian bookworm.
+- Debian bookworm
+- RedHat family (EL 8, EL 9)
+
+Per-OS-family values live in `vars/<os_family>.yml`: `sshd_package_name`
+(`openssh-server` on both) and `sshd_service_name` (`ssh` on Debian, `sshd`
+on RedHat). These are loaded automatically and used by the install task and
+the restart handler.
